  unitName: "Terry Bogard (7\u2605)"
  unitId: 830177
  unitNumber: 8215
  description: A charismatic street-savvy fighter, Terry's curiosity was piqued when
    he received an invitation to the unheard-of Scarlet Abyss Tournament. While it
    sounded a little strange, his gut told him that there was more to this event
    than was apparent. The invitation led him to an abandoned warehouse in South
    Town, where he found a pitch-black portal opened in its center. As if drawn by
    a mysterious force, Terry's body stepped into the portal against his own will.
    The last thing he remembered before losing consciousness was the fierce assault
    on his mind that seemed to drown him in contemptuous rage...
  summonDesc: I'm not going to pull my punches!<br>Never have, never will!
  fusionDesc: This is what makes a legend!<br>Yeah!
  evoDesc: The best just keeps getting better!<br>So lighten up!
  element: 3
  rarity: 6
